---
title: "Score navigation"
author: alpelito7
format:
  html:
    embed-resources: true
filters:
  - mdm
---

With **Score navigation** on, the text is frozen and the keys go to the staff: the arrows walk a cursor, `1` to `7` write a note where it stands, and `Space` plays.

```{.abc .play}
X:1
%%score {RH LH} Ped
%%stretchlast true
M:4/4
L:1/4
Q:1/4=120
K:D
V:RH
z4 | z4 | z4 | z4 |]
V:LH clef=bass
z4 | z4 | z4 | z4 |]
V:Ped clef=bass
z4 | z4 | z4 | z4 |]
```
